     </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="e.bff.app" value="authorize_url" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1D4ED8;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.8743;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.8743;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;jettySize=auto;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="app">
     <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" x="0.0000">
     </mxGeometry>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="panel" value="&lt;b&gt;What happens&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;0  Before checkout the cart is read and priced live: GetCart and UpdateCart, then Catalog PriceLines and Voucher EvaluateBasket.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;1  The shopper taps Pay. PlaceOrder carries idempotency_key, cart_version and the total the shopper saw.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;2  Order checks live: the store is open, the price, the delivery quote, the deals. Any failure here commits nothing.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;3  Order holds the deals (ReserveRedemptions) and commits the order with its price lines. It is not placed yet.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;4  Order asks Payment for an authorization. Payment calls the gateway. A wallet order calls Wallet Hold instead.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;5  authorize_url goes back to the app. The shopper finishes 3DS or QR at the gateway. From here nobody waits.&lt;/font&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontColor=#0F172A;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="1440" y="110" width="296" height="430" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="n1" value="Every call carries x-brand-id, x-principal-id, x-roles, traceparent and a deadline that is passed down and never reset. No chain of sync calls is longer than two hops on the shopper's path." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#475569;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
     <mxGeometry x="24" y="830" width="1400" height="40" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
   </root>
  </mxGraphModel>
 </diagram>
