    <mxCell id="n1" value="A shopper who abandons 3DS never produces an authorized fact. The sweeper in Order closes the order after the payment window and sends payment.requested {void}. A redelivered record is a no-op: facts are deduplicated on version, commands on event_id (P-06)." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#334155;spacingLeft=2;spacingRight=2;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
